OL,3,AYemen's Houthis reportedly seize
OL,4,Astrategic Red Sea port of Mokha
OL,5,
OL,6,FYemen's Houthis have seized the
OL,7,Fstrategic Red Sea port city of Mokha
OL,8,Ffrom Saudi-backed pro-government
OL,9,Fforces, military sources and witnesses
OL,10,Fsay.
OL,12,FMokha's capture leaves the Iran-backed
OL,13,Fgroup only 75km (46 miles) away from
OL,14,Fthe Bab al-Mandab Strait, the southern
OL,15,Fgateway to a trade route that links
OL,16,FAsia and Europe.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
