OL,3,AYemen's Houthis reportedly seize
OL,4,Astrategic Red Sea port of Mokha
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Houthis said they posed no threat
OL,7,Fto international shipping but
OL,8,Freiterated their threat to target
OL,9,Fvessels from Saudi Arabia, which has
OL,10,Frelied on the Red Sea for oil exports
OL,11,Fsince the US and Israel's war
OL,12,Feffectively closed the Strait of Hormuz
OL,13,Fin the Gulf.
OL,15,FThe escalation of the conflict between
OL,16,Fthe Houthis, Yemen's government and
OL,17,FSaudi Arabia has contributed to a surge
OL,18,Fin oil prices.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
